[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `useGood != 0` → `then` arm → `good()` (any non-zero bit pattern, including
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   negatives, `INT_MIN` and `INT_MAX`)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m There are no other flags, no global/static state, no init/teardown, no `#ifdef`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m configuration branches (`grep '#if' ` finds only the header include guard), and
