[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    27[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    28[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Input shapes.** The only data the library reads through a parameter is the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    29[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `int` behind `printIntPtrLine`'s pointer. The shape axes are therefore the value
