[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    31[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    32[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * value: `0`, `1`, `-1`, `5`, `INT_MAX`, `INT_MIN`, `INT_MAX-1`, `INT_MIN+1`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    33[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   powers of two, values whose decimal form is 1 / 10 / 11 digits, values with
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    34[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   and without a `-` sign, uniformly random `i32`
