[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    36[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   an array (index 0, middle, last), aligned vs. deliberately misaligned
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    37[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * the read width is fixed at 4 bytes (`%d` / `int`); there is no size, count,
