[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    39[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   those axes do not exist for this library
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    40[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    41[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Full set of public entry points**, including the low-level ones — all four
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    42[0m:[38;5;10m[49m have external linkage and are in `nm -D`, even though only `driver` is declared
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    43[0m:[38;5;10m[49m in the header. `driver` is the convenience wrapper; `printIntPtrLine` is the
