[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    102[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // Row 3 — misaligned but readable: NOT an error on x86_64
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    103[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
